Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_jpeg.c
Line: 2119
Function: JPEGSetupEncode
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: memcmp() is called with a fixed length of 8 on sp->otherSettings.jpegtables without verifying the actual size of the JPEGTables buffer. If an application supplies a JPEGTables value shorter than 8 bytes, this compares past the end of the buffer, causing an out-of-bounds read.

Source context:
